{"seq":3,"slug":"repurchase-replenishment-trigger","title":"复购与补货触达时机编排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/post-purchase-engagement-experience-hub/onboarding-review-repurchase/repurchase-replenishment-trigger","wordCount":3096,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"复购与补货触达时机编排\">复购与补货触达时机编排</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念-复购触达是把履约时钟接进编排-而不是再发一轮营销\">核心概念：复购触达是把履约时钟接进编排，而不是再发一轮营销</h2><p>一个已履约订单携带的信息量，远大于任何拉新广告位：我们知道他买了什么、什么时候收到、是否完成安装、是否提交了评价（见<a href=\"product-onboarding-usage-education\">安装引导与上手教育</a>）。复购触达的全部价值，在于把这些已知事件翻译成一个「该补货了」的时点，并在那时用一条用户不反感的消息说出来。它和拉新的差别不在文案，而在<strong>分母</strong>：拉新的分母是曝光，复购的分母是已履约订单乘上可用的耗用节律。</p>\n<p>三个资产决定这件事能做多准：<strong>履约事件时间线</strong>（来自<a href=\"../postpurchase-journey-model/postpurchase-event-bus-state-machine\">购后事件总线与状态机</a>）、<strong>品类耗用模型</strong>、<strong>触达频控账本</strong>。前两者决定「什么时候发」，第三者决定「还能不能发」——缺一，复购编排就会退化成定时群发。把时间轴形式化：设上次购买到下次购买的间隔为随机变量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>，生存函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>、密度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，则由风险率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h(t) = f(t)/S(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 可知，最有价值的触达区间不是平均复购间隔 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{E}[T]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，而是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 接近峰值、同时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 仍足够大的那一段——早于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{E}[T]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 触达会与「还没用完」竞争，落到尾部则被竞品抢跑。可用的触发器是下面三种「时钟」之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"补货触达的三种时钟\">补货触达的三种时钟</h2><p>品类不同，可依赖的时钟不同，误判模式也不同。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时钟</th>\n<th>触发信号</th>\n<th>典型品类</th>\n<th>信号可靠性</th>\n<th>主要误判</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>耗用预测时钟</strong></td>\n<td>首用/装机事件 + 品类消耗速率</td>\n<td>咖啡胶囊、宠物粮、滤芯、耗材</td>\n<td>中，依赖品类参数与设备数</td>\n<td>多设备/多口之家消耗快于模型，提前提醒显得促销味重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>订阅周期时钟</strong></td>\n<td>订阅计划的 <code>next_billing_date</code></td>\n<td>Subscribe &amp; Save / DTC 订阅</td>\n<td>高，平台持有合同与账期</td>\n<td>支付失败、换卡导致续费中断，被误读为「主动流失」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>复购间隔时钟</strong></td>\n<td>个体与品类的历史 TBO 分布</td>\n<td>低频非消耗品、耐用品配件</td>\n<td>低，方差大</td>\n<td>礼物购买与季节性污染个体均值</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>耗用预测时钟</strong>是唯一真正面向补货的时钟。设首次交付数量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、安全库存阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span>、日消耗速率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>，则触发时点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t^\\star = (Q_0 - \\theta)/c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⋆</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>。关键在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 的估计：单件商品默认取品类先验；若用户在安装引导里填写了使用强度（每天几杯、几只宠物、几口人），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 就被个体化，触发精度立刻上一个台阶——这也是<a href=\"product-onboarding-usage-education\">安装引导与上手教育</a>里那些看似与转化无关的问卷字段的真正用途。多设备场景要用「注册设备数」乘先验速率，否则永远提醒偏早。真实的时间线信号（首用、装机完成）来自<a href=\"../postpurchase-journey-model/postpurchase-journey-stage-touchpoint\">购后旅程阶段与触点建模</a>，耗用模型只是它的一个消费者。</p>\n<p><strong>订阅周期时钟</strong>的分工不同：它不预测耗用，而是预测「续费扣款日」。Amazon Subscribe &amp; Save 用阶梯折扣把订阅锚定在 5%–15% 区间（同一次配送满 5 件可达 15%，见 <a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/gp/help/customer/display.html?nodeId=GNW5VK4BXQS9YXQP\">Amazon — Subscribe &amp; Save</a>），DTC 侧普遍由 Recharge、Bold 一类订阅平台托管账期。工程上必须区分 <code>billing_succeeded</code> 与 <code>billing_failed</code> / <code>card_expired</code>——后者是<strong>可挽回的流失</strong>，要在下一个周期前用一次独立触达（更新支付方式的深链）拦截，而不是等订阅被系统静默取消。</p>\n<p><strong>复购间隔时钟</strong>是兜底。品类无法量化耗用（一双跑鞋、一个手机壳）时，只能用个体 TBO 的分位数触发，且必须剔除礼物购买——通常以「是否发往首次收货地址、是否含礼品包装」作为清洗信号。它的价值在于覆盖前两种时钟都无信号的品类，而不在提供高精度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"订阅续费与取消的合规边界\">订阅续费与取消的合规边界</h2><p>复购编排里唯一能直接踩到监管红线的环节，是<strong>订阅自动续费与取消路径</strong>。这块政策在 2024–2025 年经历了一次真实的摇摆，必须按当前状态实现，而不是按两年前的博客。</p>\n<p>美国联邦贸易委员会 2024 年 10 月发布「Negative Option Rule」（俗称 Click-to-Cancel，编入 16 CFR Part 425），要求取消机制与订阅机制同样简单；该规则在 2025 年 7 月被第八巡回上诉法院在 Custom Communications, Inc. v. FTC 案中<strong>撤销</strong>（见 <a href=\"https://www.ftc.gov/legal-library/browse/rules/negative-option-rule\">FTC — Negative Option Rule</a>），FTC 随即表示继续依据既有法律执法——即 <strong>ROSCA</strong>（Restore Online Shoppers&#39; Confidence Act，15 U.S.C. § 8401–8405）、《联邦贸易委员会法》第 5 条对欺骗性行为的规定，以及各州自动续费法。ROSCA 对负选择交易的三条硬要求至今有效：清晰披露全部收费条款、取得消费者的<strong>明示知情同意</strong>、提供<strong>简单的取消机制</strong>。加州修订后的自动续费法（AB 2863）进一步要求在免费试用或低价期转正前取得<strong>针对该条款的单独同意</strong>；欧盟一侧，GDPR 第 21 条给用户对直接营销的<strong>绝对反对权</strong>，ePrivacy 指令第 13 条允许对既有客户就「同类产品」做软选择加入，但须在收集时提供退出、且每条消息可退订。</p>\n<p>翻译成工程约束有三条，均可静态校验：<strong>取消路径不得比订阅路径更长</strong>（取消入口的点击深度、字段数、验证步骤 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span></span></span></span></span> 订阅路径，写进发布检查）；<strong>转正前必须取单独同意</strong>（试用/折扣条款确认是一次独立可留痕动作，不能藏在注册表单的单一勾选框里）；<strong>退出必须与目的绑定且全局可执行</strong>（取消营销订阅要落到抑制表并向所有下游发送服务广播，而非只改一个渠道的偏好位）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"通道-频控与-疲劳-是一等约束\">通道、频控与「疲劳」是一等约束</h2><p>复购触达的边际收益衰减得比拉新更快：同一条补货提醒打扰三次，第三次的期望收益通常为负。把疲劳建成显式成本，编排才可优化。设第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 次触达的转化概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、单次毛利 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span>、发送成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、疲劳惩罚 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda L(k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，则第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 次是否值得发取决于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Π</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mi>g</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta\\Pi_k = p_k g - c_s - \\lambda L(k) &gt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>。由此得到两个机制：<strong>纵向频控</strong>（同一用户、同一目的设跨渠道冷却期）与<strong>横向频控</strong>（同一时间窗内所有目的合计上限）。关键在于频控账本必须<strong>跨渠道共享</strong>——各渠道各自计数会让用户在一天内同时收到多家的提醒。</p>\n<p>通道选择由合规成本与场景共同决定：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>通道</th>\n<th>授权门槛</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n<th>硬约束</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>邮件</td>\n<td>既有客户同类产品可用软选择加入</td>\n<td>耗用提醒、续费预告</td>\n<td>投诉率需低于 Google 发件人指引建议的 0.3%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>App 推送</td>\n<td>系统级授权</td>\n<td>即时补货、续费失败拦截</td>\n<td>授权一旦关闭近乎不可逆</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>短信</td>\n<td>美国营销短信需<strong>事先明示书面同意</strong>并完成 10DLC 登记</td>\n<td>高时效的续费失败挽回</td>\n<td>单条成本高，投诉后果重</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>电子邮件的投诉率不是软建议：Google 与 Yahoo 自 2024 年起对批量发件人执行统一要求，明确要求垃圾邮件投诉率保持在 0.3% 以下，长期触及会导致投递降级（见 <a href=\"https://support.google.com/a/answer/81126\">Google — Email sender guidelines</a>）。对百万级名单的商家，一次全量补货群发的投诉增量就足以吃掉数周的投递信誉。</p>\n<h2 id=\"编排实现-事件驱动加冷却状态机\">编排实现：事件驱动加冷却状态机</h2><p>把上面三节折成一个可实现的形态：以履约事件为输入、以「补货窗口」为中间状态、以冷却期收尾的状态机。核心是<strong>每个（用户，目的）组合持有一个冷却计时器</strong>，任何一次触达都会重置它，且补货窗口未被消费时会自然过期。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;上次履约订单&lt;br/&gt;订单明细 + 数量&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;耗用模型&lt;br/&gt;估算 c 与耗尽时点&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;补货窗口开启&lt;br/&gt;t* 前 lead 时间&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; D{&quot;冷却期已过?&quot;}&#10;  D -- 否 --&gt; E[&quot;抑制&lt;br/&gt;写入待发队列下轮&quot;]&#10;  D -- 是 --&gt; F{&quot;通道授权有效?&quot;}&#10;  F -- 否 --&gt; G[&quot;降级到次优通道&lt;br/&gt;或落站内清单&quot;]&#10;  F -- 是 --&gt; H[&quot;发送补货提议&lt;br/&gt;可一键再下单&quot;]&#10;  H --&gt; I[&quot;重置冷却计时器&lt;br/&gt;跨渠道共享&quot;]&#10;  I --&gt; J{&quot;窗口内下单?&quot;}&#10;  J -- 是 --&gt; K[&quot;关闭窗口&lt;br/&gt;重算下一轮 t*&quot;]&#10;  J -- 否 --&gt; L[&quot;窗口过期&lt;br/&gt;升级为流失预警&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"上次履约订单&lt;br/&gt;订单明细 + 数量\"] --&gt; B[\"耗用模型&lt;br/&gt;估算 c 与耗尽时点\"]\n  B --&gt; C[\"补货窗口开启&lt;br/&gt;t* 前 lead 时间\"]\n  C --&gt; D{\"冷却期已过?\"}\n  D -- 否 --&gt; E[\"抑制&lt;br/&gt;写入待发队列下轮\"]\n  D -- 是 --&gt; F{\"通道授权有效?\"}\n  F -- 否 --&gt; G[\"降级到次优通道&lt;br/&gt;或落站内清单\"]\n  F -- 是 --&gt; H[\"发送补货提议&lt;br/&gt;可一键再下单\"]\n  H --&gt; I[\"重置冷却计时器&lt;br/&gt;跨渠道共享\"]\n  I --&gt; J{\"窗口内下单?\"}\n  J -- 是 --&gt; K[\"关闭窗口&lt;br/&gt;重算下一轮 t*\"]\n  J -- 否 --&gt; L[\"窗口过期&lt;br/&gt;升级为流失预警\"]</pre><p>实现上要注意三件事。<strong>幂等</strong>：耗用模型的重算会反复产出同一个「窗口开启」事件，发送服务必须以 <code>(user_id, window_id)</code> 去重，否则一次重算就可能触发群发。<strong>时区与静默时段</strong>：静默时段按收件人当地时间而非仓库时区计算，跨境场景下两者常相差 8–13 小时（与<a href=\"../tracking-proactive-communication/delivery-eta-exception-intervention\">配送 ETA 与异常干预</a>的时区处理同源）。<strong>降级而非丢弃</strong>：通道授权失效时降级到站内清单，让窗口在用户下次进 App 时仍可被消费。</p>\n<p>订阅续费是同一状态机的分支：以 <code>billing_failed</code> 为触发进入短窗口做支付方式挽回，成功回到正常周期，失败进入订阅取消——此处<strong>不得</strong>用比正常更短的挽回期制造紧迫感，那在多个司法辖区会被判为欺骗性设计。跨设备身份还需与<a href=\"../postpurchase-journey-model/journey-identity-resolution-profile\">旅程身份解析与画像</a>对齐，否则同一个人的两笔订单会被当成两个主体的冷却账本，频控形同虚设。</p>\n<h2 id=\"度量-用留出组证明增量-而不是用归因证明相关性\">度量：用留出组证明增量，而不是用归因证明相关性</h2><p>复购触达最常见的度量错误，是把「触达后 30 天内的复购率」当作效果——这个数字含大量本来就会复购的人（自然复购），它随品类周期波动而不随编排质量波动。可用口径只有一个：<strong>留出组（holdout）</strong>，随机让一部分符合条件的用户不进入触达，比较两组复购率之差，即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>uplift</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>treat</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>holdout</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>holdout</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{uplift} = (r_{\\text{treat}} - r_{\\text{holdout}})/r_{\\text{holdout}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">uplift</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">treat</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">holdout</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">holdout</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。留出组必须按（用户，目的）分层随机；对低频耐用品，单品级实验往往要跑数月，更实际的做法是<strong>在品类层面共享留出组</strong>，牺牲一点精度换取可观测。</p>\n<p>除增量外，必须同时盯三个<strong>护栏指标</strong>：退订/推送关闭率水位、垃圾邮件投诉率、订阅取消率。任一次补货活动只要让护栏显著恶化，即使 uplift 为正也应回滚——退订是<strong>永久性</strong>的，它偷的是未来的触达额度。也因此，补货触达的终极目标不是「这一单」，而是让「按需补货」内化成习惯：当订阅续费成为低摩擦的默认，复购率就不再依赖一次次说服。所有触达的事件定义与<a href=\"../tracking-proactive-communication/proactive-notification-orchestration\">主动通知编排</a>共用，回流到统一口径。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>复购与补货触达的编排，本质是把履约后已知的两件事——<strong>买了什么</strong>与<strong>什么时候会用完</strong>——翻译成一个不打扰人的时点。三种时钟各有适用面：耗用预测时钟最精确但依赖品类参数与装机信号，订阅周期时钟最可靠但要区分可挽回的支付失败，复购间隔时钟兜底但需清洗礼物与季节性噪声。合规上，订阅续费的取消路径必须与订阅路径同等简单、转正前需单独同意、退出必须落到全局抑制表；这些在 2024–2025 年美国规则被撤销后，仍由 ROSCA 与各州自动续费法约束。工程上把三者折成一个事件驱动、带跨渠道共享冷却的状态机，用留出组而非归因度量增量，并把退订率与投诉率当作与转化同等的护栏。做到这些，复购就是一个由履约时钟驱动的确定性系统，而不是赌运气的群发。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>三种时钟分工</strong>：耗用预测最精确但依赖品类/装机信号，订阅周期最可靠但要区分可挽回支付失败，复购间隔兜底但需清洗礼物与季节噪声。</li>\n<li><strong>合规红线</strong>：订阅取消与订阅同等简单、转正单独同意、退订落全局抑制表；美国 2024–2025 规则撤销后仍受 ROSCA 与各州自动续费法约束。</li>\n<li><strong>工程形态</strong>：事件驱动 + 跨渠道共享冷却的状态机，增量用留出组而非归因度量，退订率/投诉率作为与转化同等的护栏。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"复购与补货触达时机编排","id":"复购与补货触达时机编排"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：复购触达是把履约时钟接进编排，而不是再发一轮营销","id":"核心概念-复购触达是把履约时钟接进编排-而不是再发一轮营销"},{"level":2,"text":"补货触达的三种时钟","id":"补货触达的三种时钟"},{"level":2,"text":"订阅续费与取消的合规边界","id":"订阅续费与取消的合规边界"},{"level":2,"text":"通道、频控与「疲劳」是一等约束","id":"通道-频控与-疲劳-是一等约束"},{"level":2,"text":"编排实现：事件驱动加冷却状态机","id":"编排实现-事件驱动加冷却状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"度量：用留出组证明增量，而不是用归因证明相关性","id":"度量-用留出组证明增量-而不是用归因证明相关性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"评价激励策略与评论合规治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/post-purchase-engagement-experience-hub/onboarding-review-repurchase/review-solicitation-compliance"},"next":{"title":"互动平台架构与消息通道集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/post-purchase-engagement-experience-hub/engagement-platform-metrics/engagement-platform-architecture"}}